---
import { regions } from '../data/regions';
import { serviceOfferings } from '../data/site-offerings';
---
<footer class="brand-dark bg-brand-navy bg-brand-pattern border-t border-sand-dark/40 pt-16 pb-8">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-12 mb-16">
      
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3 self-start" aria-label="iDecal – về trang chủ"><img src="/images/idecal-logo.png" alt="Logo iDecal" class="h-10 w-10" /><span class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">iDecal</span></a>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-inverse leading-relaxed">
          <strong>iDecal</strong> – Đơn vị hơn 10 năm kinh nghiệm thiết kế, in ấn và thi công Decal quảng cáo, dán kính chống nóng chuyên nghiệp.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-sand font-bold mb-6 text-[17px]">Dịch vụ tiêu biểu</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-brand-inverse">
          <li><a href="/dich-vu" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Xem tất cả dịch vụ →</a></li>
          {serviceOfferings.map(service => <li><a href={`/dich-vu/${service.slug}`} class="hover:text-white transition-colors">{service.name}</a></li>)}
        </ul>
        <a href="/san-pham" class="mt-5 inline-block text-sm font-medium text-brand-sky hover:text-white">Xem danh mục sản phẩm →</a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-sand font-bold mb-6 text-[17px]">Khu vực phục vụ</h4>
        <ul class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 gap-y-3 text-sm text-brand-inverse">
          {regions.map(region => <li><a href={`/khu-vuc/${region.slug}`} class="hover:text-white transition-colors">{region.shortName}</a></li>)}
        </ul>
        <a href="/khu-vuc" class="mt-5 inline-block text-sm font-medium text-brand-sky hover:underline">Xem tất cả khu vực →</a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-sand font-bold mb-6 text-[17px]">Thông tin liên hệ</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-brand-inverse">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-sand-dark shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"/><path d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
            <span>Phục vụ tại TP. Hồ Chí Minh và các khu vực lân cận</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-sand-dark shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z"/></svg>
            <a href="tel:0866077040" class="font-bold text-brand-sky">0866.077.040</a>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-sand-dark shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7l9 6 9-6"/><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/></svg>
            <a href="mailto:hi@idecal.vn" class="text-brand-sky hover:text-white transition-colors">hi@idecal.vn</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-white/15 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 text-[12px] text-brand-inverse">
      <p>© 2026 iDecal. All rights reserved.</p>
      <a href="/lien-he-idecal" class="hover:text-white">Liên hệ iDecal</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
